<title>GREECE: Table of Greek central bank fixing rates, Aug 1.</title>
<headline>Table of Greek central bank fixing rates, Aug 1.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing rates for leading  currencies on Friday were as follows.</p>
<p>------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:	Aug 01     July 31   Dec 31 96    CHANGE</p>
<p>								 FROM YR-END</p>
<p>------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  287.880     286.460     247.020   16.54 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  307.800     308.000     306.830    0.32 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  155.975     156.210     158.970   -1.88 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   46.270	46.334	47.182   -1.93 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  472.600     468.680     419.180   12.74 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  138.470     138.685     141.685   -2.27 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   15.990	16.009	16.185   -1.20 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  242.300     242.150     212.430   14.06 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	   1.8480	1.8510	1.8880   -2.12 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	   1.5430	1.5460	1.5810   -2.40 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  190.200     188.955     183.135    3.86 %</p>
<p>Note: The net change is calculated as the percentage difference between  the most recent fixing rate and the December 31, 1996 rate.</p>
<p>--Angelos Kiosklis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
